		(property "Note" "12V rail sense. Set FSR to +/-4.096V - the default +/-2.048V clips the 2.92V full scale the divider plus D1 clamp can produce. LSB is 2.0 mV = 11.1 mV referred to the 12V side. ADDR to GND selects 0x48, clear of the X1202 fuel gauge at 0x36, LSM6DSOX at 0x6B and BMP384 at 0x77. AIN2/AIN3 to GND and ALERT/RDY floating, both per the datasheet Unused Inputs section. AIN1 is spare. 150 uA operating, 0.5 uA powered down."
