		(property "Quote" "Rev 1.0 quote PCBWay T-B4W341056A (2026-08-14) is SUPERSEDED - that board was withdrawn before fabrication. Rev 2.0 needs a fresh RFQ. Prior status, kept for provenance: PCBWay T-B4W341056A (5 units, 2026-08-14): PCBWay saw two part numbers on this line and asked which to quote; operator answered ABLS2-40.000MHZ-D4YF-T. Not yet priced. The stray second part number came from the SnapEDA library symbol's MP / MF / Package fields (the 12 MHz donor part) leaking into the BOM export; those have been cleared so it cannot recur."
