					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Quote" "MPN set to the generic Zener part number, consistent with this board's treatment of 1N4148W. Suffix varies by maker (Diodes -7-F, onsemi T1G, Nexperia ,215) and is a distributor choice at order time."
